boards/cubepilot/cubeorangeplus: hil variant with pwm_out_sim

The default build of the Cube Orange+ has no simulation modules, so with SYS_HITL=1 the rcS line
`pwm_out_sim start -m hil` fails: no HIL_ACT_* parameters, no HIL_ACTUATOR_CONTROLS, no HITL. This label variant
(make cubepilot_cubeorangeplus_hil) is the default board plus pwm_out_sim only; PX4's code is unchanged.

diff --git a/boards/cubepilot/cubeorangeplus/hil.px4board b/boards/cubepilot/cubeorangeplus/hil.px4board
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/boards/cubepilot/cubeorangeplus/hil.px4board
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+CONFIG_MODULES_SIMULATION_PWM_OUT_SIM=y
